     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Dear colleagues,</div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\">\r\n<p><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Next month I will be offering a <strong>Psychometrics workshop</strong> with Statistical Horizons, featuring hands-on applications of <strong>lavaan </strong>for EFA, CFA, MIMIC models, and MGCFA.</font></p>\r\n<p><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">📅 <strong>Dates:</strong> Wednesday, November 12 – Friday, November 14, 2025<br>\r\n🕙 <strong>Time:</strong> 10:00 AM – 3:30 PM (EST)</font></p><p><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">💻 <strong>Format:</strong> Live via Zoom — with full recordings for asynchronous learning</font></p><p>\r\n</p><p><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">👉 <a href=\"https://statisticalhorizons.com/seminars/psychometrics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://statisticalhorizons.com/seminars/psychometrics/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792413046818000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2z5YD9QOQEiToNzQnkbb2u\">View full workshop details and registration</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a href=\"http:///\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http:///&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792413046818000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hyJUicSvidyZCfLRH-vh4\"></a></font></p>\r\n<p><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">🎓 Introducing the new <a href=\"https://statisticalhorizons.com/resources/measurement-and-psychometrics-certification-program/?utm_source=simplycast&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=psy-cert-2025-sc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://statisticalhorizons.com/resources/measurement-and-psychometrics-certification-program/?utm_source%3Dsimplycast%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dpsy-cert-2025-sc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792413046818000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Y2BEInO4HR6zIB1G1YBcd\"><em>Measurement &amp; Psychometrics Certificate</em></a></font></p></div></div><div>\r\n<p><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">This <span class=\"gmail_default\">Psychometrics </span>workshop is part of the brand-new <strong>Certificate Program</strong> from Statistical Horizons — a comprehensive training sequence covering:</font></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span></font></strong><strong style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">AI-assisted item writing and scale development</strong></p>\r\n</li><li><p><strong><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span class=\"gmail_default\">Exploratory </span>Factor <span class=\"gmail_default\">Analysis (EFA)</span></font></strong></font></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span></font></strong><strong><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Exploratory Graph Analysis (EGA)</font></strong></p></li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span></font></strong><strong><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Item Response Theory (IRT)</font></strong></p>\r\n</li><li><p><strong><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Latent Class <span class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span>Analysis (LCA)</font></strong></p></li></ul><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">…and more</span><span class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span><br><ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">For questions about the workshop or the new certificate, <span class=\"gmail_default\">please </span>reach out:</font></p><p>\r\n<font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">📧 <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\">die...@statisticalhorizons.com<span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></font></p><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Thanks,<br>Matt</font></div><br></div><span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Matthew A. Diemer<br></font></div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Chair, Combined Program in Education and Psychology </font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Professor, Educational Studies</font></div></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Professor of Psychology, College of Literature, Science, and\r\nthe Arts</span> (by courtesy)<span></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></p></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Faculty Associate, Research Center for Group Dynamics, Institute for Social Research</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">Marsal Family School of Education | University of Michigan</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;wh